<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-STRANSKY SCORES TRY ON FULL ENGLISH DEBUT.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-STRANSKY SCORES TRY ON FULL ENGLISH DEBUT.</headline>
<dateline>LEICESTER, England 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Springbok fly-half Joel Stransky scored a try in his first full league game in English rugby on Saturday.</p>
<p>Stransky, a key member of the South African World Cup winning side of 1995, crossed for one of Leicester's six tries in their 53-19 mauling of Bristol.</p>
</text>
